                <note rend="inline" type="source">852.00/2780: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Ambassador in Spain</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Bowers</hi>), <hi rendition="#italic">Then in
                        France</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1936-08-25T19:00:00-04:00">August 25, 1936—7
                        p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>B–6. Your August 24, 11 a.m., and your 76, August 25, noon. I approve your
                    decision not to attend this meeting. As regards the question of your attendance
                    at any future meetings, I feel that I must leave the matter to your discretion.
                    You may, of course, consult me about any particular meeting.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
